{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-12-07 16:15:00', 'title': "CPC'S MICROCNX SERIES CONNECTORS RECEIVE TOP BIOPHARMA INDUSTRY HONOR", 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , DEC. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CPC (COLDER PRODUCTS COMPANY), PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV) AND A LEADING MANUFACTURER OF CONNECTION TECHNOLOGIES USED IN BIOPHARMACEUTICAL PROCESSING, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS MICROCNX® SERIES CONNECTORS\xa0WERE NAMED A 2022 PHARMA INNOVATION AWARD WINNER.'}